codex
I’ve found two distinct layers: `WorldSnapshot` first builds its own node sphere tree, then 
`WorldSnapshot::update` instantiates in-range nodes; the object only reaches `ClientWorld`’s 
tangible tree through the object’s notification on `Object::addToWorld`. I’m now checking 
constructors/templates to pin down which notification each snapshot-created class carries.
