1687:		//   the phased parse is still running (player logging in inside a
1688:		//   client-cached POB). A miss against the partial map must not become
1689:		//   a silent no-op -- finish the parse first, then answer exactly.
1690:		//   (The int-max guard above already excludes most live server ids.)
